  "description": "Leerang has had a lot of bad luck, but getting tricked into being buried alive as the bride of a ghost might really take the cake. Leerang is tied to the ghost by a red string of fate, and somewhere between the world of the living and the dead, she’s slowly dying. Just then a blue snake appears and tells her that she can return to the living if she ties herself to him instead. But there’s a reason Tajin has been sealed beneath the earth for the past three hundred years, and now she has no choice but to find out why. \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
